LISA MP-cluster-F
Scopes=(sys (gpu (cluster (cta 0) (cta 1))))
"Hand-written cluster-scope MP, release-acquire variant; exercises CudaLang inline-PTX cluster ld/st (sm_90)"
{
}
 P0                     | P1                      ;
 w[relaxed,cluster] x 1 | r[acquire,cluster] r0 y ;
 w[release,cluster] y 1 | r[relaxed,cluster] r1 x ;

scopes: (sys (gpu (cluster (cta 0) (cta 1))))
exists (1:r0=1 /\ 1:r1=0)
